'''Eevee Bag''' (Japanese: '''イーブイのバッグ''' ''Eievui Bag'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Choose 1:
① During this turn, attacks used by your Pokémon that evolve from {{TCGP|Eevee}} do +10 damage to your opponent's Active Pokémon.
<br>
② Heal 20 damage from each of your Pokémon that evolves from {{TCGP|Eevee}}.
}}

